2 CONT The daughter of a Privy Councilor of the city of Mecklenburg , Matthias von Linstow.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Married Johan Björnsson Printz in Stockholm (1641), and accompanied Johan Björnsson Printz to Delaware (1642): https://www.degruyter.com/view/books/9781512814477/9781512814477-002/9781512814477-002.xml
