1 NOTE {geni:about_me} senior
2 CONT
2 CONT Probably born circa 1500 - died (in Antwerp) before 1553
2 CONT
2 CONT Had a brother Lambert (canon in Aachen, died circa 1559) and a sister Anna Munten
2 CONT
2 CONT Married ca 1525 Agatha Mertens, daughter of Jan Mertens and Katlijne Margriete Mertens
2 CONT
2 CONT Thibalt Pruynen, mentioned as a legal guardian of the Munthe children in 1559 and married to Margriete.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lodewijck  Sr and Agatha had following children;
2 CONT
2 CONT Adam - merchat, agent in Antwerp for Merten Martens (uncle) in Leipzig. Married to Johanna Montens, daughter of Willem Montens and Christijne Verlith.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie - married to Jan Morissen
2 CONT
2 CONT Margriete - married to Anthonis Raes
2 CONT
2 CONT Cornelis - merchant trading on "Eastland".
2 CONT
2 CONT Lodewijck Jr (Ludwig) - ca 1530 merchant, citizen in Lubeck. Documents found in Lubeck.
2 CONT
2 CONT Erasmus - with legan guardian Thibalt Pruynen.
