2 CONT Brita Pedersdotter Stiernfelt född 1615-01-06 på Ryds gård, Linköpings sn, † 1647-08-20 av barnsbörd i Iglau, numera Tjeckien. Gift 1635-12-08 i Stralsund, Pommern med översten Clas Bengtsson Kugelhielm 
2 CONT
2 CONT If you arrive here as a descendant, take a moment and appreciate this:  Brita died at 32 years-old from childbirth complications, far from home. She gave birth to at least 9 children, in several different countries. 5 of these chi
2 CONC ldren died in infancy, 1 other daughter died approx. 9 years-old, a few years after her mother passed away.   
