2 CONT Engelbrekt Johan, born 1683-01-25. Rider at the Turku County Cavalry Regiment 1700.  Korpral at the Turku County Cavalry Regiment 1700. Quartermaster 1706.  Kornett 1708-10-31.  Captivated 1709-07-01 at Perevolotjna and brought to
2 CONC  Tobolsk, from where he arrived 1722-07-00.  Rider's resignation 1722-11-26.  Died 1748-01-13 in Pori.  He was unmarried, but according to royal letter, 1724-11-28,  was convicted of marrying by Anna Helena Dööst according to the 
2 CONC church law. (F.)
