2 CONT * Appelbom first married on 11 April 1639 to Malin Andersdotter (born 1615), daughter of councilor Anders Andersson and Ingrid Hansdotter Svan in Stockholm . Together they had the children registrar Anders Appelbom and Ingrid Appe
2 CONC lbom (died 1684) who was married to colonel Hieronymus Lindeberg .The son Anders Appelbom was a registrar in the office and is said to have died abroad. As a wife, the latter had a daughter of Daniel Behmer from his first marriage
2 CONC . The latter had a son, Harald Appelbom (1669-1730), court assessor and married to Barbara Magdalena Ehrenhielm whose mother was a Gyldenbring , with whom he had several children who died in infancy, a daughter married to Ehrenhie
2 CONC lm, and the son Harald Appelbom (1711-1783) who was chancellor and married the first time to a Gyldenbring, with whom he had two children who died young. Thus the oldest branch of the family started.
