1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Holger Jørgensen Rosenkrantz=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Jørgen Ottesen Rosenkrantz and Dorthe Gundesdatter Lange
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married= 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Sophie Axelsdatter Brahe''' on 13-08-1598 in Malmö Sweden. The wedding took place at Malmøhus Sweden,  where her sisters Birgitte and Anne were simultaneously married to Henrik Gøye and Eiler Qvitzow, respectively. I
2 CONC n 1598, he married Sophie Brahe (1578–1646) and they had 13 children, eight of whom survived to adulthood. Upon his father's death, Rosenkrantz inherited Rosenholm Castle and following his mother's death in 1613, he inherited Skaf
2 CONC øgård. In 1627, he withdrew from political life and devoted himself to theological writing. His commitment to theology and education became so ardent that he relinquished his fief and retired to Rosenholm, where he fully immersed 
2 CONC himself in his studies and Christian life. He maintained correspondence with theologians across Europe
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =History=  
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1617, King Christian IV appointed Holger Rosenkrantz as a councillor of the realm. Rosenkrantz played an important role in the king's restoration and reform of the school system in Denmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT The academy, as it was later called, was founded by Holger Jørgensen Rosenkrantz (1574-1642) with the nickname 'the learned'. Rosenkrantz was an internationally recognized theologian, and Rosenholm can therefore be compared to Tyc
2 CONC ho Brahe's (1546-1601) natural science academy at Uranienborg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Holger Rosenkrantz (December 14, 1574 at Kalø Castle – October 28, 1642 in Copenhagen) was a Danish nobleman, councillor of the realm, theologian and educator. He is considered one of the wisest Danes of the 17th century, and was 
2 CONC known as "the learned Holger". Holger Rosenkrantz to Rosenholm and Øster Vallø.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Family Group Record  	FamilySearch™ Ancestral File v4.19=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Father:  	Jorgen ROSENKRANTZ 
2 CONT * Mother:  	Dorte LANGE 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Name: '''Holger ROSENKRANTZ;''' Born: 14 Dec 1574 in Kalo, Randers, Denmark. Died:  29 Oct 1642 in Copenhagen, Copenhagen, Denmark.  Buried in Hornslet Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married= 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married:  Sophie BRAHE; on August 13 1598 in Malmo, Malmohus, Sweden.  Sophie BRAHE; Born: on 11 May 1578 in Odense, Odense, Denmark . Died: on 21 Dec 1646 in Copenhagen, Denmark. Buried in Frue Church 	 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Six sons and seven daughters were born from his marriage to Sophie Brahe. Five children died early=
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1.  '''Mette ROSENKRANTZ;'''Born on 27 Feb 1600 in Rosenholm, Hornslet, Randers, Denmark. Christened:  	9 Mar 1600 in Rosenholm, Hornslet, Randers, Denmark. Died on 21 Dec 1644.
2 CONT * 2 - '''Jorgen ROSENKRANTZ;'''   	Born on 1 Jul 1601 in Rosenholm, Hornslet, Randers, Denmark. Died on 6 Jun 1605.
2 CONT * 3 - '''Otte ROSENKRANTZ;'''Born on 2 Feb 1603 in Rosenholm, Hornslet, Randers, Denmark. Died: 15 Feb 1606.
2 CONT * 4 - '''Gunde ROSENKRANTZ;'''Born:  	2 Dec 1604 in Rosenholm, Hornslet, Randers, Denmark. Died:  	2 Dec 1675.
2 CONT * 5 - '''Ide ROSENKRANTZ;'''Born on 22 Mar 1606 in Rosenholm, Hornslet, Randers, Denmark . Died:  	5 Feb 1609 in in Rosenholm, Hornslet, Randers.
2 CONT * 6 - '''Jorgen ROSENKRANTZ;''' Born:  11 Jul 1607 in Rosenholm, Hornslet, Randers, Denmark. Died: 8 Jan 1675 in Sore, Denmark . married Christence Juel (1612–1680)
2 CONT * 7 - '''Beate ROSENKRANTZ;''' Born on 15 Oct 1608 in Rosenholm, Hornslet, Randers, Denmark. Died on 20 Feb 1647 in Ringe, Svendborg, Denmark. 
2 CONT * 8 - '''Otte ROSENKRANTZ;''' Born on 24 Sep 1610 in Rosenholm, Hornslet, Randers, Denmark. Died:  	7 Jul 1639.
2 CONT * 9 - Erik ROSENKRANTZ; Born on 12 Mar 1612 in Rosenholm, Hornslet, Randers, Denmark. Died on 13 Oct 1681. 
2 CONT * 10 -  '''Dorte ROSENKRANTZ;'''  Born:  Abt 1613 in Rosenholm, Hornslet, Randers, Denmark . married to Otte Thott
2 CONT * 11-. '''Ide Margrethe ROSENKRANTZ;''' Born: in 1616 in Rosenholm, Hornslet, Randers, Denmark . Died in 1616 	
2 CONT * 12 - '''Ide Margrethe ROSENKRANTZ;'''Born on 17 Apr 1617 in Rosenholm, Hornslet, Randers, Denmark. Died:  	7 Apr 1624. 
2 CONT * 13 - '''Sophie ROSENKRANTZ'''  Died in 1677 in Assens, Odense, Denmark .-
