1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Birgitta Wolff=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Clas Wolff and Anna Unknown 
2 CONT * Death:	September 1659 (68) in Landskona, Sweden
2 CONT
2 CONT * Landskrone was Danish until 1658 so most of the city's population were of course Danes like the people in Copenhagen or Malmö or Odense, after 1658 some of the offices (councilors, mayors, etc.) were taken over by Swedes. It's h
2 CONC ard to tell if she had been Swedes or Danes and if the latter had moved to Landskrone from another part of the country, I suppose you could not find her born in Landskrone? Do you have no other information about her? Vulff, Wulf, 
2 CONC Wulff genera found throughout the Nordic region at the time most immigrated from Germany. 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married:  '''Gynter Göransson Rosenschantz, ( nr 570)''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Johan Carl''' , born 1644. Captain. Death 1713. Johan Carl (son of Gynter Göransson, adlad Rosenschantz, Tab. 1), born 1644-05-26 at Koldingshus å Jutland. Member of Jakob Stegman's regiment. Lieutenant at the nitric acid reg
2 CONC iment 1675-08-03. Finally called the captain. Died 1713-05-12 in Femsjö parish, Jönköping County. Married 1666-08-21 with Maria Catharina Svinhufvud in Västergötland, born 1649-04-11 at Röksberg in Mulseryds parish, Jönköping Coun
2 CONC ty, died 1720-02-11 on her farm Lilla Duvhult in Femsjö parish, daughter of Major Jöns Svinhufvud in Västergötland , and Beata Gyllenswaard .
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Margareta''' .
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Magnus Jacob''' . Captain. Death 1709. Magnus Jakob (son of Gynter Göransson, adlad Rosenschantz, Tab. 1), to Hedenlunda in Vadsbro parish, Södermanland county. Student in Uppsala 1663-03-14. Musketeer by Major General Dellvi
2 CONC g's regiment. Driver at the Health Regiment. Requested in 1674 to become a member of the Hälsingregementet. Was captain in 1693. He died in 1693 when he claimed to be alone on the men's line and in writing with the knighthood and 
2 CONC nobility in a black robe to mourn Queen Ulrika Eleonora, since he lost not only his father, Colonel Gynter Rosenschantz , but also lost all his property by the reduction. ' Married 1st 1676 with Brita Maria Stuart in her 2nd marri
2 CONC age (married 1st 1660-01-06 at Hedenlunda with Major Johan Lilliecrona, born 1619, died 1672), lived 1689, daughter of Chamberlain Anders Stuart the Younger, No. 86, and Margareta Heideman. Married 2nd in the 1690s with Maria Utte
2 CONC r , daughter of Major Peter Utter , and his 1st wife Sidonia Lillie af Aspenäs .
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Anton Gynter'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source - ''''''Rosenschantz nr 570'''''' - https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Rosenschantz_nr_570
2 CONT
