1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Captain Johan Carl Gyntersson Rosenschantz, (nr 570)=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Johan Carl (son of Gynter Göransson, adored Rosenschantz), born 1644-05-26 at Koldingshus to Jutland. Fenrik by Jakob Stegman's regiment. Lieutenant at the Sisters Regiment 1675-08-03. 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000003897396702?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000080989395862&position=4 '''Birth Record:'''  May 26, 1644 in Koldinghus slot, Kolding, Vejle, Danmark]
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000003897396702?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000088841122933&position=0 '''Death Record:''' 1713-05-12 in Femsjö parish, Jönköping County]
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000003897396702?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000080989377217&position=3 '''Place of burial:''' Captain Johan Carl Rosenschantz Buried at the Femsjö kirke Halland Sverige]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Captain Johan Carl Gyntersson Rosenschantz Death Record'''
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id= 6000000088841122933&size=large}}
2 CONT '''Translation of Johan Carl Gyntersson Rosenschantz Death Record into English:'''  On May 12th, God called through temporal [earthly] death, the former Noble and Well-born Sir Johan Carl Rosenschantz, who was born in Jutland at K
2 CONC oldinghus Castle in the year 1644. On May 26th, he was buried in Femsjö Churchyard, by the Southern Church wall, just outside the Parish priest’s [Stall or Window], buried May 25th."
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married 1666-08-21 with [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000003897396702?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000089005859855  '''Maria Catharina Svinhufvud'''] in Västergötland, born 1649-04-11 at Röksberg in Mulseryds pari
2 CONC sh, Jönköping County, died 1720-02-11 on his farm Lilla Duvhult in Femsjö parish, daughter of the Major Jöns Svinhufvud in Västergötland and Beata Gyllensvärd 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children of Johan Carl Rosenschantz and Maria Catharina Svinhufvud=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Beata''' . Married 1690-10-04 with korpralen Knut Andersson Svan in Yaböke (in Femsjö socken).
2 CONT * '''Johan Georg''' . Lieutenant. Death 1719. 
2 CONT * '''Märta''' . Married 1710-03-27 with Korpralen Bengt Jonsson in Frillalt (in the Femsjö parish).
2 CONT * '''Christina''' . Married 1711-05-17 with boy Bengt Andersson from Eskilsbo in Torup parish, Halland County.
2 CONT * '''Anna Rosina''' , born 1680, died 1762-11-00 in Stockholm. Married to piecewoman E. Westh .
2 CONT * '''Catharina''' , born 1688, died 1773-11-20 in Gränna and in Gränna buried 1773-11-30. Married to the country fisherman Rafael Björkengren , born 1693, dead 1750-01-06 in Gränna.
2 CONT
