2 CONC ghgrefvelig Underdån Tienare: ödmiukaste ts Excell, Johan Carl Rosenschantz "letter is not dated, but it should be from sometime in the 1680 's.No response to the letter, I have not as of yet found, but he owned the farm Yaböke fo
2 CONC r a few more years, and was a resident at the seat the farm until 1693 and also received kyrkskatten height with 100% to 2 daler silver coins.
