2 DATE 1 NOV 1592
2 PLAC Julita
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Gimmersta
3 CITY Tyresö
3 STAE Södermanland
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 6 DEC 1654
2 ADDR
