1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Lt. Col. Ernst Johann von Berg=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Ernst Johann von Berg''' is from one of the families '''Berg''' / '''von Berg''' in Estonia and / or Livonia, three of which have been ennobled, but which appear not to share any particular common ancestry. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''To be more specific''', of those three, Ernst Johann comes from a family von Berg which goes under the name (''The House of'') [https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berg_(P%C3%A4ri%29 '''Kattentack''] which is a reference to the sourc
2 CONC e of origin of the family, at some point in time. Most likely to Kattentack in 1745 when the family was ennobled under n:o 8. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berg_(P%C3%A4ri%29 '''Kattentack'''] is used to distinguish the family from other families Berg, namely [https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berg_(Kandla%29 '''Kandla''' (''Kandel'')] and [https://et.wikip
2 CONC edia.org/wiki/Berg_(Kaarma%29 '''Kaarma''' (''Carmel'')], other [https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eestimaa_r%C3%BC%C3%BCtelkonna_aadlimatrikkel noble families from Estonia] and / or [https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liivimaa_r%C3%BC%C3%
2 CONC BCtelkonna_aadlimatrikkel Livonia].
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Kattentack is a''' [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/German_exonyms German exonym] for '''Päri Manor''' or [https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/P%C3%A4ri_m%C3%B5is_(Kullamaa%29 '''Päri mõis'''] in [https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kullamaa
2 CONC  '''Kullamaa''' (Goldenbeck)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (There is also) a ''Kattentack'' or ''Kattentaken'' or [https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaspere_m%C3%B5is Aaspere mõis] also in in Virumaa / Vironia / Wierland. I hope I have not had those mixed up.) 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''von Berg married''' to [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Von_Liewen_nr_45#TAB_2 '''Helena Liwe''' (von Liewen)] in 1637, daughter of '''Jürgen Liwe''', friherre '''Liwe, till Parjental''' och Stenhusen and his first wife ''
2 CONC 'Elisabet Yxkull, till Kosch'''. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''von Berg has been''' tagged as a ''gateway ancestor'' because via his three sons he is the progenitor of three major branches of this von Berg (of Kattentack) family.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1.''' '''The Teenuse''' ('''''Stenhusen''''') '''branch''' stems from '''Otto Reinhold'''. Most of his descendants nowadays live in Belgium. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''2. The Madalmaade''' ('''''Netherlands''''') branch, stemming from '''Ernst Wilhelm''', leads to, well... the Netherlands, but also to the United Kingdom. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. '''The Luiste branch''', stemming from '''Gustaf''', leads to Livonia, and soon branches further to other branches including, but not limited to, branches Sangaste, Holstre, and Veļķi. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Branches of the family''' have in different countries been raised even into the ranks of Counts. 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Berg / Kattentack (n:o 8)=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''(House of)''' [https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berg_(P%C3%A4ri%29 '''Kattentack'''] is used to distinguish the family from other families Berg, namely [https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berg_(Kandla%29 '''Kandla''' (Kandel)] and [htt
2 CONC ps://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berg_(Kaarma%29 '''Kaarma''' (Carmel)], other [https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eestimaa_r%C3%BC%C3%BCtelkonna_aadlimatrikkel noble families from Estonia] and / or [https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liivimaa_r%
2 CONC C3%BC%C3%BCtelkonna_aadlimatrikkel Livonia].
2 CONT
2 CONT ////
2 CONT
2 CONT http://daten.digitale-sammlungen.de/~db/bsb00000600/images/index.html?seite=673&fip=193.174.98.30
2 CONT
2 CONT Service 14.06.1660 The service was still available in 1536 in the village of Tolli manor in Märjamaa parish, but in 1560 it was already marked as a manor. Joint owners with Tolli manor until 1660, when Jürgen, Reinhold p Lieven in
2 CONC herited the division of the manor and villages with Jöffern, Urrifer and Allo 12 plots to his daughter Helene's wife to male judge Ernst Johann Berg 09.02.1688 Ernst Johann, Otto p Bergrija (+1693) his son Otto Reinhold Berg (+169
2 CONC 6), whose widow Sophie Elisabeth, Jakobi t Berg (born Stael von Holstein) married Hans Johann Gyllenlood in 1697 (possessed in 1704). Customs and Service manors are exempt from reduction
2 CONT
2 CONT =Berg (Päri)=
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berg_(P%C3%A4ri%29 '''Berg (Kattentack)'''] n:o 8, "''Berg Päri kojast''", eristamaks neid teistest Bergi-nimelistest suguvõsadest [https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berg_(Kandla%29 '''Kandla'''] ja [htt
2 CONC ps://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berg_(Kaarma%29 Kaarma] on Eestimaa ja Liivimaa aadlisuguvõsa. 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Ernst Johann von Berg=
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Ooberstleitnant Ernst Johann von Bergi (1610−1693) poegadest põlvnes suguvõsa kolm pealiini: i) '''''Teenuse''''', ii) '''''Madalmaade''''' ja iii) '''''Luiste''''' haru.===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Married to''' [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Von_Liewen_nr_45#TAB_2 '''Helena Liwe'''] in 1637. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ////
2 CONT
2 CONT http://daten.digitale-sammlungen.de/~db/bsb00000600/images/index.html?seite=673&fip=193.174.98.30
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.eha.ee/kinnistud/kinnistud.php?module=65&op=3&kid=16650&ringkond=Tallinn-Haapsalu+KA%3A+M%F5isad&alates=&ridu=20&hypoteek=&nr=&k_nr=&aadress=&eesnimi=&perenimi=&fond=&nimistu=&sailik=&asukoht=teenuse&kinnistud_nr=276 T
2 CONC eenuse] 
2 CONT 14.06.1660 Teenuse oli veel 1536. a Tolli mõisa küla Märjamaa kihelkonnas, aga 1560. a märgitud juba mõisana. Ühised omanikud Tolli mõisaga kuni aastani 1660, kui Jürgen, Reinholdi p Lieveni pärandusejagamise lepinguga langes mõis
2 CONC  ja külad Jöffern, Urrifer ja Allo 12 adramaaga tema tütre Helene abikaasale meeskohtunik Ernst Johann Bergile
2 CONT 09.02.1688 Ernst Johann, Otto p Bergi (+1693) pärija on tema poeg Otto Reinhold Berg (+1696), kelle lesk Sophie Elisabeth, Jakobi t Berg (sünd Stael von Holstein) abiellub 1697. a Hans Johann Gyllenloodiga (valdas 1704. a). Tolli 
2 CONC ja Teenuse mõisad on reduktsioonist vabastatud
2 CONT
2 CONT Ajalooarhiivi AIS register: Eestimaa ülemmaakohus > Kohtumenetlus > Kohtutoimikud >  Pealkiri Ernst Johann Berg in Namen seiner Mutter Dorothea von Treyden, seeligen Rittmeister Otto Bergs zu Pall nachgelassenen Witwe '''contra de
2 CONC n Bruder seiner Mutter, Jürgen von Treyden zu Cornal (Cournal)('''Kurna, Jüri) betreffend Mitgabeforderung aus Cournal  Piirdaatumid 11.02'''.1652''' <br/>
2 CONT <br/>
