1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ''' Hovikirurgin sisar''' Agnes Margareta Ribe (1677–1720)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Agnes Margateta Ribe'''. While she was married to [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Wallenstierna_nr_1034#TAB_3 Olof Walenstierna] from Turku, chances are she died in Sweden because she died in 1720. Wallenstierna escaped t
2 CONC he Russians from Finland, and to Sweden during the Great Northern War, which only ended in 1721. In addition, had she died in Finland, she'd probably have been buried in the Turku Cathedral, but there's no source saying that took 
2 CONC place. 
