1 NAME Charles Magnus /Wrangel/
2 GIVN Charles Magnus
2 SURN Wrangel
2 _MARNM Wrangel
2 NICK Carl
1 NAME Carl Magnus /Wrangel/
2 GIVN Carl Magnus
2 SURN Wrangel
2 _MARNM Wrangel af Sage
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 23 AUG 1727
2 PLAC Östra Benbäck
2 ADDR
3 STAE Västmanland
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 12 JUN 1786
